{
  "id": "E057",
  "title": "The best choice for the holiday",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2016-10-22",
  "synopsis": "Annie and Li Li are talking about whether or not it is worth traveling in China during National holidays.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/257/c335aaee038bccc2e8a7de2e2bd110d1001d99d2.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "假期最好的选择\n\n安妮：李力，国庆节你有什么安排？\n李力：我还没想好呢。\n安妮：我们一起去北京玩怎么样？听说北京的秋天特别美。\n李力：的确，可是人也特别多。\n安妮：可是我真的很想去看看北京的秋天。\n李力：我们可以在国庆旅游高峰期之后再去。\n安妮：那我们就国庆节后的第一个周末去吧。\n李力：好啊。\n安妮：可是，我们国庆节做什么好呢？\n李力：我们就逛逛街，看看电影吧。\n安妮：好吧，看来这是假期最好的选择了。",
    "traditional": "假期最好的選擇\n\n安妮：李力，國慶節你有什麼安排？\n李力：我還沒想好呢。\n安妮：我們一起去北京玩怎麼樣？聽說北京的秋天特別美。\n李力：的確，可是人也特別多。\n安妮：可是我真的很想去看看北京的秋天。\n李力：我們可以在國慶旅遊高峰期之後再去。\n安妮：那我們就國慶節後的第一個週末去吧。\n李力：好啊。\n安妮：可是，我們國慶節做什麼好呢？\n李力：我們就逛逛街，看看電影吧。\n安妮：好吧，看來這是假期最好的選擇了。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The best choice for the holiday"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "安妮：李力，国庆节你有什么安排？",
      "traditional": "安妮：李力，國慶節你有什麼安排？",
      "pinyin": "ān nī lǐ lì guó qìng jié nǐ yǒu shén me ān pái",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie:  Lili , do you have any plans for the National holiday?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "李力：我还没想好呢。",
      "traditional": "李力：我還沒想好呢。",
      "pinyin": "lǐ lì wǒ hái méi xiǎng hǎo ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li li:  I don’t know yet."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "安妮：我们一起去北京玩怎么样？听说北京的秋天特别美。",
      "traditional": "安妮：我們一起去北京玩怎麼樣？聽說北京的秋天特別美。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī wǒ men yì qǐ qù běi jīng wán zěn me yàng tīng shuō běi jīng de qiū tiān tè bié měi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie:  How about we travel to Beijing together? It is said Beijing is especially beautiful in autumn."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "李力：的确，可是人也特别多。",
      "traditional": "李力：的確，可是人也特別多。",
      "pinyin": "lǐ lì dí què kě shì rén yě tè bié duō",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li li:  Indeed, but there are also a lot of people."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "安妮：可是我真的很想去看看北京的秋天。",
      "traditional": "安妮：可是我真的很想去看看北京的秋天。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī kě shì wǒ zhēn de hěn xiǎng qù kàn kan běi jīng de qiū tiān",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie:  But I do want to see Beijing in autumn."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "李力：我们可以在国庆旅游高峰期之后再去。",
      "traditional": "李力：我們可以在國慶旅遊高峰期之後再去。",
      "pinyin": "lǐ lì wǒ men kě yǐ zài guó qìng lǚ yóu gāo fēng qī zhī hòu zài qù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li li:  We can go when the National Day tourist peak is over."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "安妮：那我们就国庆节后的第一个周末去吧。",
      "traditional": "安妮：那我們就國慶節後的第一個週末去吧。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī nà wǒ men jiù guó qìng jié hòu de dì yī ge zhōu mò qù ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie:  Then let’s go the first weekend after the National holiday."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "李力：好啊。",
      "traditional": "李力：好啊。",
      "pinyin": "lǐ lì hǎo a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li li:  Good."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "安妮：可是，我们国庆节做什么好呢？",
      "traditional": "安妮：可是，我們國慶節做什麼好呢？",
      "pinyin": "ān nī kě shì wǒ men guó qìng jié zuò shén me hǎo ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie:  Then what should we do during the National holiday?"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "李力：我们就逛逛街，看看电影吧。",
      "traditional": "李力：我們就逛逛街，看看電影吧。",
      "pinyin": "lǐ lì wǒ men jiù guàng guang jiē kàn kan diàn yǐng ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li li:  How about we just go shopping and watch some movies?"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "安妮：好吧，看来这是假期最好的选择了。",
      "traditional": "安妮：好吧，看來這是假期最好的選擇了。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī hǎo ba kàn lái zhè shì jià qī zuì hǎo de xuǎn zé le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie:  Yeah, it seems like this is the best choice for the holiday."
    }
  ],
